FAQ = [('What is the ground clearance of a Ford Bronco?', 'From 8.3 in to 13.1 in for 2026, depending on the tires the truck was built with. A Base on 30 in tires has 8.3 to 8.4 in; the Raptor on 37 in tires has 13.1 in.'), ('How much clearance does the Sasquatch Package give?', "11.6 in on the 2-door and 11.5 in on the 4-door, on 35 in tires, by Ford's sheet."), ('How deep can a Bronco ford water?', 'Ford lists a maximum of 31.5 in for the 30, 32 and 33 in tire builds, 33.5 in with the Sasquatch Package and 37.0 in for the Raptor. Ford adds: always determine the depth before crossing and proceed slowly.'), ('Does the 2-door have better angles than the 4-door?', 'The breakover angle is better on the shorter 2-door: 28.9 degrees against 26.3 with the Sasquatch Package. Approach angles are the same.')]

